WEBVTT

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:02.062
Time travel starts on the dance floor.

00:00:02.465 --> 00:00:06.874
Pick a decade and listen to what changes
when the DJ drops the first track.

00:00:07.134 --> 00:00:10.376
Every Retro Glam Session
Night is built around one era.

00:00:10.779 --> 00:00:13.485
A seventies disco edition
has a different sound,

00:00:13.856 --> 00:00:16.850
lighting design and atmosphere
from an eighties neon night.

00:00:17.111 --> 00:00:21.616
We carry that idea through the stage,
the DJ set and the photo moments.

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:25.577
Your guests step into a room designed
around the music they came to hear.

00:00:25.837 --> 00:00:28.886
Our producers coordinate décor,
multimedia,

00:00:29.285 --> 00:00:31.716
catering, staffing and logistics.

00:00:32.119 --> 00:00:36.062
We select the vendors and call their cues
so the night moves as one show.

00:00:36.322 --> 00:00:39.454
That craft comes
from more than two hundred and fifty small

00:00:39.468 --> 00:00:42.915
and midsize events,
in addition to our corporate productions.

00:00:43.175 --> 00:00:44.920
Explore the decade editions.

00:00:45.323 --> 00:00:48.166
Join the invitation list
for a night that speaks to you,

00:00:48.551 --> 00:00:51.875
or ask about a private Retro
Glam experience for your group.
